    "product_details_zLqMHy": {
      "type": "product-details",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_tab_RUr9bM": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<h6><strong>WHY IT IS DIFFERENT</strong></h6><p>Ordinary glasses are designed to block, filter, or darken light. Hyperlight Optics®️ goes beyond traditional eyewear by using proprietary ZC60-X™ nanophotonic technology engineered to intelligently restructure incoming light into a more balanced and biologically compatible form. The result is a visual experience designed to feel calmer, clearer, less aggressive to the eyes and brain, and more supportive of modern high-performance lifestyles.</p><p>More than vision correction. More than blue-light protection. A new way of experiencing light.</p><h6><strong>BENEFITS</strong></h6><p>• Reduced eye strain and visual fatigue<br/>• Protection from LED, neon, and aggressive blue light exposure<br/>• Filters harmful UV radiation while preserving and transforming beneficial natural light<br/>• Enhanced visual comfort, contrast, and clarity<br/>• Support for focus and cognitive performance<br/>• Reduced glare and light overstimulation<br/>• More balanced and relaxed visual experience</p><h6><strong>DESIGNED FOR DIFFERENT ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h6><p>Depending on the model and lens, Hyperlight Optics®️ glasses can be used for:<br/>• Computer and screen exposure<br/>• Office and indoor environments<br/>• Driving (day & night) and travel<br/>• Sports and outdoor activities<br/>• Bright sunlight and high-glare conditions<br/>• Everyday indoor/outdoor transitions</p><p></p>",
            "metafields": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CynxAR": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Technology",
            "content": "<p>Hyperlight Optics are unique because of the special nanophotonic materials used in their production, which transform ordinary, diffused light into a new light that is considerably more compatible with our biomolecules. The unique carbon-based ZC60-X nanostructure acts as an ultra-fast photonic resonator. As light passes through the optical layer, Fullerene C60 twists more than 18 billion times per second, helping reorganize and transform incoming light into a more ordered and coherent form. This creates what we define as HyperQuantum™️ Light — structured light with improved biological compatibility.</p><p>Hyperlight Optics®️ does not simply darken vision. It intelligently transforms light into a more comfortable and biologically supportive visual environment for everyday indoor and outdoor use. </p>",
            "metafields": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_tnX7hE": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Specifications",
            "content": "<p>1. The protective layer is on both sides of the lens.</p><p>2. Hydro and oleophobic coating: protects against scratching and facilitates cleaning and has an antistatic component that repels dust particles from both sides of the lens.</p><p>3. Patented 8 layers of ion coatings: following the Ioncoat K+ process, eight layers of material with different index levels are vacuum applied to the lenses. Ioncoat K+ reduces light reflection to less than 1%, resulting in better vision.</p><p>4. Optimizing the Hard layer (HC): specially matched with the anti-reflection process and the superhydrophobic layer, it extends the life of the anti-reflection layer and provides additional protection against scratches.;</p><p>5. Fullerene layer on both sides of the lens.</p><p>6. CR 39 lenses.</p>",
            "metafields": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_i9RTLJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Technical data",
            "content": "<p>Model: {{ product.metafields.custom.model_name.value }}</p><p>Item code: {{ product.metafields.custom.item_code.value }}</p><p>Enviroment: {{ product.metafields.custom.enviroment1 | metafield_text: field: 'enviroment' }}</p><p>Gross weight (Kg): {{ product.metafields.custom.gross_weight_kg_.value }}</p><p>Net weight (Kg): {{ product.metafields.custom.net_weight_kg_.value }}</p><p>Dimensions (mm): {{ product.metafields.custom.dimensions.value }}</p>",
            "metafields": ""
          }
        }
      },
