      "blocks": {
        "content_gALaUR": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Dual-Layer Lens Protection System",
            "text": "<p>Following the Fullerene C60 Patented coating, the base ultra-clear lens features two protective layers on both sides: the first layer contains Anti-scratch, STC, and Hydro and oleophobic coating, while the second layer consists of Anti-reflex with 8 layers of ion coating.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "vertical": 50,
            "horizontal": 5,
            "vertical_mobile": 78,
            "horizontal_mobile": 5
          }
        },
        "content_NMTmLA": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Base ultra-clear lens",
            "text": "<p>The premium base ultra-clear lens delivers exceptional optical clarity and maximizes light transmission for crystal-clear vision.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "vertical": 40,
            "horizontal": 10,
            "vertical_mobile": 57,
            "horizontal_mobile": 18
          }
        },
        "content_aJJx4a": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Fullerene C60 Patented coating",
            "text": "<p>The revolutionary Fullerene C60 coating, applied to both sides of the base ultra-clear lens, integrates space-derived carbon molecules into Hyperlight Optics. Acting as a nanophotonic generator, it creates Hyperlight – a unique light structure that matches healthy biostructures' symmetry, helping restore natural homeostasis through resonance principles.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "vertical": 52,
            "horizontal": 17,
            "vertical_mobile": 82,
            "horizontal_mobile": 32
          }
        },
        "content_zHcRap": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Anti-reflex, 8 layers of ion coating",
            "text": "<p>The sophisticated anti-reflective system consists of 8 precision-applied layers of ion coating, effectively eliminating unwanted light reflections and glare while maximizing light transmission for superior visual clarity.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "vertical": 33,
            "horizontal": 20,
            "vertical_mobile": 37,
            "horizontal_mobile": 36
          }
        },
        "content_76Km9T": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Blue mirror coloring coating*",
            "text": "<p>For outdoor models, a specialized coating creates a blue mirror effect on the lens surface, providing an attractive reflective blue finish while effectively reflecting sunlight for enhanced outdoor performance.</p><p>*only for outdoor models</p>",
            "link": "",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "vertical": 39,
            "horizontal": 32,
            "vertical_mobile": 59,
            "horizontal_mobile": 57
          }
        },
        "content_4q9gaA": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "Anti-scratch, STC, Hydro and oleophobic coating",
            "text": "<p>A comprehensive protective layer combines anti-scratch resistance, STC (Superior Top Coat), and hydro/oleophobic properties to defend against scratches while repelling water, oil, and fingerprints for easier cleaning and clearer vision.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "vertical": 25,
            "horizontal": 46,
            "vertical_mobile": 13,
            "horizontal_mobile": 77
          }
        }
